# Placeholder vendor sepolicy for meizu_m6.
#
# The build is androidboot.selinux=permissive (BoardConfig.mk cmdline) and
# SELINUX_IGNORE_NEVERALLOWS is on.
#
# That is not a guess about A13 - it is measured one Android version down. FACT:
# the LineageOS 16.0 lane had to set the same flag for this exact family, and
# recorded why: "Pie public-policy neverallows reject Oreo-era MTK vendor rules
# (first hits: dac_override for mtk_wmt_loader / mtk_gsm0710muxd /
# mtk_aee_core_forwarder)"
# (gunwest-import/m6rom16/rom-work/device/meizu/m3_meizu_m6-common/BoardConfigCommon.mk).
# A13's public policy is strictly stricter than Pie's.
#
# Nothing real can be written here until a kernel boots far enough to produce a
# single avc denial log on this device under Android 13.
